## 3. The consumer repoint

### [CXC-STORE-CONSUMER-SEAMS] The two client seams that must repoint doc:// / :8421 to bus://

- seam-resolve: `python/composeio/resolve.py` — `resolve_doc`, `query_docs`, `put_doc`.
- seam-docstore-client: `python/composeio/docstore.py` — `DocumentStoreClient`.
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-STORE]

### [CXC-STORE-CONSUMER-SEAMS-YAML] The YAML/config repoint surface — not just the two Python seams

- consumer-docstore-viewer: `apps/compose_platform_launch_bar/docstore_viewer.compose.yaml` — the Document-Storage viewer app.
- consumer-launch-bar-tile: `apps/compose_platform_launch_bar/launch_bar.compose.yaml` tile 5, the "Document Storage" launcher tile, which routes to `_app/docstore/open`.
- consumer-shell-launcher: `apps/composeux-shell/launcher.compose.yaml` — `doc://surfaces/launcher`.
- consumer-minnow-turbot-restore: `compose_projects/minnow-bringup/*.compose.yaml` and `turbot-bringup.compose.yaml` — restore pick-lists that are themselves document_store queries.
- consumer-deploy-compose: `services/document_store/deploy/docker-compose.yml` — not repointed, dies with the service.
- dsd-source: docs/architecture/DSD-storage-consolidation.md
- see-also: [CXC-STORE-CONSUMER-SEAMS]
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-STORE]

### [CXC-STORE-CONSUMERS] The ~5 consumers that move doc:// / :8421 to bus:// / the unified store

- consumer-shell: `apps/composeux-shell/shell.py` — the launcher.
- consumer-admin: `admin/admin_app.py`.
- consumer-bsg: the BSG engine, `compose_projects/bsg/engine/`.
- consumer-widgets: `python/composeio/render/widgets/store_browser.py` and `doc_picker.py` — `doc_picker.py` is also where [DD-STORE-QUERY-DISPOSITION]'s client-side filter lands.
- consumer-pixel-comparison: `python/scripts/pixel_comparison.py`.
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-STORE]

